		(at 142.5 113 180)
		(descr "C128 power: square 5-pin DIN (DP-215 type) male plug insert, pins through the board, plug on the top side. Contacts on the DIN-8 grid: centre + 4 diagonals of a 7.0 mm circle (4.95 mm square). Key towards +y. Round DIN-8 insert (7 around + centre) with the 3 unused pins pulled; it has NO key for the square socket, the case must key it.")
